    💭 What a shield adds
    🔡 check 🔤a new shield adds three headers, in this order🔤 📃🐇🔬🔸🛡 🆕🛡❗️❗️ 🔤X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff|X-Frame-Options: DENY|Referrer-Policy: same-origin🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤a header can be added to the set🔤 📃🐇🔬🔸🛡 🔖 🆕🛡❗️ 🔤Content-Security-Policy🔤 🔤default-src 'self'🔤❗️❗️ 🔤X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff|X-Frame-Options: DENY|Referrer-Policy: same-origin|Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤one of the set is replaced by its name, in any case, and stays in its place🔤 📃🐇🔬🔸🛡 🔖 🆕🛡❗️ 🔤x-frame-options🔤 🔤SAMEORIGIN🔤❗️❗️ 🔤X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff|X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN|Referrer-Policy: same-origin🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤and taken out by an empty value🔤 📃🐇🔬🔸🛡 🔖 🆕🛡❗️ 🔤REFERRER-POLICY🔤 🔤🔤❗️❗️ 🔤X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff|X-Frame-Options: DENY🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤taking out what is not there changes nothing🔤 📃🐇🔬🔸🛡 🔖 🆕🛡❗️ 🔤X-Nothing🔤 🔤🔤❗️❗️ 🔤X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff|X-Frame-Options: DENY|Referrer-Policy: same-origin🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤a name that no header could have changes nothing🔤 📃🐇🔬🔸🛡 🔖 🆕🛡❗️ 🔤Bad Name🔤 🔤x🔤❗️❗️ 🔤X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff|X-Frame-Options: DENY|Referrer-Policy: same-origin🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤every header can be taken out🔤 📃🐇🔬🔸🛡 🔖 🔖 🔖 🆕🛡❗️ 🔤X-Content-Type-Options🔤 🔤🔤❗️ 🔤X-Frame-Options🔤 🔤🔤❗️ 🔤Referrer-Policy🔤 🔤🔤❗️❗️ 🔤🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤the browser can be told to come back over HTTPS only, for so many seconds🔤 📃🐇🔬🔸🛡 ⏳ 🆕🛡❗️ 31536000❗️❗️ 🔤X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff|X-Frame-Options: DENY|Referrer-Policy: same-origin|Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤and not to be told so after all🔤 📃🐇🔬🔸🛡 ⏳ ⏳ 🆕🛡❗️ 31536000❗️ 0❗️❗️ 🔤X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff|X-Frame-Options: DENY|Referrer-Policy: same-origin🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤seconds below zero are none too🔤 📃🐇🔬🔸🛡 ⏳ 🆕🛡❗️ -1❗️❗️ 🔤X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff|X-Frame-Options: DENY|Referrer-Policy: same-origin🔤❗️

    💭 A response that has one already
    📬 🆕🛡❗️ 🔖 ✅🐇📬 🔤x🔤❗️ 🔤x-frame-options🔤 🔤SAMEORIGIN🔤❗️❗️ ➡️ own
    🎁 check 🔤a response that has one of the headers keeps its own value🔤 🏷 own 🔤X-Frame-Options🔤❗️ 🔤SAMEORIGIN🔤❗️
    🔢 check 🔤and is not given a second🔤 📏 📚 own 🔤X-Frame-Options🔤❗️❓ 1❗️
    🎁 check 🔤the others are added beside it🔤 🏷 own 🔤Referrer-Policy🔤❗️ 🔤same-origin🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤and the response is the one it was🔤 📄 own❗️ 🔤x🔤❗️

